### GO TO (Legacy, Avoid)

**Warning:**
GO TO is part of COBOL but creates "spaghetti code" and should be avoided in modern development.

```cobol
       ❌ AVOID THIS:
       PERFORM CALC-SECTION.
       GO TO SKIP-SECTION.
       PERFORM SKIP-SECTION.
       GO TO END-PROGRAM.
       
       ✅ USE THIS INSTEAD:
       PERFORM CALC-SECTION.
       IF CONDITION-MET
           PERFORM SKIP-SECTION
       END-IF.
```

