## File Handling

### File Organization & Access

**Theory:**
COBOL has three main file organizations.

```
SEQUENTIAL
├── Records read one by one
├── Fast for batch processing
└── Example: Log files, transaction feeds

RELATIVE
├── Access by relative position
├── Example: Fixed-size records

INDEXED (Indexed Sequential)
├── Access by key
├── Fast lookups
└── Example: Employee database
```

**Sequential File Processing:**

```cobol
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STUDENT-REPORT.
       
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT STUDENT-FILE ASSIGN TO 
               'students.dat'
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
           
           SELECT REPORT-FILE ASSIGN TO
               'student-report.txt'
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
       
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD STUDENT-FILE.
       01 STUDENT-RECORD.
           05 STU-ID       PIC 9(5).
           05 STU-NAME     PIC X(30).
           05 STU-GPA      PIC 9(2)V99.
       
       FD REPORT-FILE.
       01 REPORT-RECORD   PIC X(80).
       
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-EOF           PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01 WS-COUNTER      PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-TOTAL-GPA    PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE 0.
       
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
           PERFORM READ-AND-REPORT.
           PERFORM PRINT-SUMMARY.
           STOP RUN.
       
       READ-AND-REPORT.
           OPEN INPUT STUDENT-FILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT REPORT-FILE.
           
           PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
               READ STUDENT-FILE
                   AT END
                       MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
                   NOT AT END
                       ADD 1 TO WS-COUNTER
                       ADD STU-GPA TO WS-TOTAL-GPA
                       PERFORM WRITE-REPORT-LINE
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM.
           
           CLOSE STUDENT-FILE.
           CLOSE REPORT-FILE.
       
       WRITE-REPORT-LINE.
           STRING STU-NAME DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " - GPA: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               STU-GPA DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO REPORT-RECORD
           END-STRING.
           WRITE REPORT-RECORD.
       
       PRINT-SUMMARY.
           MOVE SPACES TO REPORT-RECORD.
           WRITE REPORT-RECORD.
           
           COMPUTE AVG-GPA = 
               WS-TOTAL-GPA / WS-COUNTER.
           
           STRING "Total Students: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-COUNTER DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " Average GPA: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               AVG-GPA DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO REPORT-RECORD
           END-STRING.
           WRITE REPORT-RECORD.
```

