## Advanced Concepts

### String Operations

**Theory:**
COBOL provides powerful string manipulation.

```cobol
       STRING-OPERATIONS.
       
           STRING FIRST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
               " " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               LAST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
               INTO FULL-NAME
           END-STRING.
           ← Creates: "John Smith"
       
           UNSTRING FULL-NAME
               DELIMITED BY SPACE
               INTO FIRST-NAME, LAST-NAME
           END-UNSTRING.
           ← Splits into parts
       
           INSPECT TEXT REPLACING FIRST
               SPACE BY "-"
           ← Replaces first space with hyphen
       
           INSPECT TEXT REPLACING ALL
               SPACE BY "-"
           ← Replaces all spaces
       
           MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(TEXT) TO TRIMMED-TEXT.
           ← Removes leading/trailing spaces
       
           MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(TEXT) TO NUMBER.
           ← Converts string to number (with validation)
       
           IF TEXT CONTAINS "ERROR"
               DISPLAY "Error found"
           END-IF.
```

---

### CALL Statement (Modularity)

**Theory:**
COBOL supports calling external modules/programs.

```cobol
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       
       CALL-SUBROUTINE.
           CALL "CALCULATE" USING BY VALUE 10
               BY REFERENCE RESULT
               RETURNING COMPLETION-CODE.
           
           IF COMPLETION-CODE NOT = 0
               DISPLAY "Subroutine failed"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "Result: " RESULT
           END-IF.
```

**Subroutine:**

```cobol
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALCULATE.
       
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 INPUT-NUMBER     PIC 9(5).
       01 OUTPUT-RESULT    PIC 9(9).
       
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-SQUARE        PIC 9(9).
       
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING INPUT-NUMBER 
           BY REFERENCE OUTPUT-RESULT
           RETURNING COMPLETION-CODE.
       
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           COMPUTE WS-SQUARE = INPUT-NUMBER ** 2.
           MOVE WS-SQUARE TO OUTPUT-RESULT.
           MOVE 0 TO COMPLETION-CODE.
           GOBACK.
```

**Key Points:**
- ✅ BY VALUE passes copy of data
- ✅ BY REFERENCE passes address
- ✅ RETURNING returns value
- ✅ GOBACK returns to caller
- ✅ LINKAGE SECTION for parameters

