### Copybooks (Code Reuse)

**Theory:**
Copybooks are shared code modules included in multiple programs.

```cobol
       ← File: EMPLOYEE-COPYBOOK.txt
       01 EMPLOYEE-RECORD.
           05 EMP-ID           PIC 9(5).
           05 EMP-NAME         PIC X(30).
           05 EMP-DEPARTMENT   PIC X(20).
           05 EMP-SALARY       PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 EMP-HIRE-DATE    PIC 9(8).
       
       ← Using in program:
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY EMPLOYEE-COPYBOOK.
       
       ← Now EMP-ID, EMP-NAME, etc. are available
```

