### Payroll System Example

**Complete System:**

```cobol
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL-PROCESSING.
       
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT EMPLOYEE-FILE ASSIGN TO 
               'employees.txt'
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
           
           SELECT PAYROLL-FILE ASSIGN TO
               'payroll-report.txt'
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
       
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD EMPLOYEE-FILE.
       01 EMPLOYEE-RECORD.
           05 EMP-ID           PIC 9(5).
           05 EMP-NAME         PIC X(30).
           05 HOURLY-RATE      PIC 9(4)V99.
           05 HOURS-WORKED     PIC 9(3)V99.
       
       FD PAYROLL-FILE.
       01 PAYROLL-OUTPUT      PIC X(100).
       
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-VARIABLES.
           05 WS-EOF           PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           05 WS-TOTAL-PAY     PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-OVERTIME      PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-OVERTIME-PAY  PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-GROSS-PAY     PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-TAX           PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-NET-PAY       PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-EMP-COUNT     PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
       
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
           PERFORM PROCESS-PAYROLL.
           PERFORM PRINT-SUMMARY.
           STOP RUN.
       
       PROCESS-PAYROLL.
           OPEN INPUT EMPLOYEE-FILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT PAYROLL-FILE.
           
           PERFORM WRITE-HEADER.
           
           PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
               READ EMPLOYEE-FILE
                   AT END
                       MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
                   NOT AT END
                       ADD 1 TO WS-EMP-COUNT
                       PERFORM CALCULATE-PAY
                       PERFORM WRITE-PAY-RECORD
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM.
           
           CLOSE EMPLOYEE-FILE.
           CLOSE PAYROLL-FILE.
       
       CALCULATE-PAY.
           IF HOURS-WORKED > 40
               COMPUTE WS-OVERTIME = 
                   HOURS-WORKED - 40
               COMPUTE WS-OVERTIME-PAY = 
                   WS-OVERTIME * 
                   HOURLY-RATE * 1.5
               COMPUTE WS-GROSS-PAY = 
                   (40 * HOURLY-RATE) +
                   WS-OVERTIME-PAY
           ELSE
               COMPUTE WS-GROSS-PAY = 
                   HOURS-WORKED * HOURLY-RATE
           END-IF.
           
           COMPUTE WS-TAX = WS-GROSS-PAY * 0.15.
           COMPUTE WS-NET-PAY = 
               WS-GROSS-PAY - WS-TAX.
           
           ADD WS-NET-PAY TO WS-TOTAL-PAY.
       
       WRITE-PAY-RECORD.
           STRING 
               EMP-ID DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " - " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               EMP-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
               " | Gross: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-GROSS-PAY DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " | Tax: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-TAX DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " | Net: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-NET-PAY DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO PAYROLL-OUTPUT
           END-STRING.
           WRITE PAYROLL-OUTPUT.
       
       WRITE-HEADER.
           MOVE "PAYROLL REPORT" TO PAYROLL-OUTPUT.
           WRITE PAYROLL-OUTPUT.
           MOVE "=" TO PAYROLL-OUTPUT.
           WRITE PAYROLL-OUTPUT.
       
       PRINT-SUMMARY.
           MOVE SPACES TO PAYROLL-OUTPUT.
           WRITE PAYROLL-OUTPUT.
           
           STRING 
               "Total Employees: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-EMP-COUNT DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO PAYROLL-OUTPUT
           END-STRING.
           WRITE PAYROLL-OUTPUT.
           
           STRING
               "Total Net Pay: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-TOTAL-PAY DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO PAYROLL-OUTPUT
           END-STRING.
           WRITE PAYROLL-OUTPUT.
```

**Key Features:**
- ✅ File I/O for input and output
- ✅ Conditional logic for overtime
- ✅ Arithmetic for payroll calculations
- ✅ String operations for formatting
- ✅ Summary reporting

