               *> Annual salary up to $99,999,999.99
           
           05 START-DATE           PIC 9(8).
               *> Date format: YYYYMMDD
           
           05 DEPARTMENT-CODE      PIC X(3).
               *> HR, IT, FIN, OPS, etc.
           
           05 ACTIVE-FLAG          PIC X VALUE 'Y'.
               *> Y or N
           
           05 EMAIL                PIC X(50).
               *> Email address
