## Operators & Expressions

### Theory: COBOL Arithmetic Operations

**Operation Hierarchy (PEMDAS):**
```
1. Parentheses    ()
2. Exponentiation **
3. Multiplication *, Division /
4. Addition +, Subtraction -

Example: 2 + 3 * 4 = 14 (NOT 20)
         (2 + 3) * 4 = 20 (with parentheses)
```

### Practical Examples: All Operators

```cobol
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NUMBERS.
           05 NUM-A                PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE 25.00.
           05 NUM-B                PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE 5.00.
           05 RESULT               PIC 9(6)V99.
       
       01 WS-TEXT.
           05 TEXT-A               PIC X(20) VALUE "Hello".
           05 TEXT-B               PIC X(20) VALUE "World".
           05 COMBINED-TEXT        PIC X(50).
       
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       
       ARITHMETIC-OPERATIONS.
           *> ADDITION
           ADD NUM-A TO NUM-B GIVING RESULT.
           *> RESULT = 30.00
           
           *> SUBTRACTION
           SUBTRACT NUM-B FROM NUM-A GIVING RESULT.
           *> RESULT = 20.00
           
           *> MULTIPLICATION
           MULTIPLY NUM-A BY NUM-B GIVING RESULT.
           *> RESULT = 125.00
           
           *> DIVISION
           DIVIDE NUM-A BY NUM-B GIVING RESULT.
           *> RESULT = 5.00
           
           *> DIVISION WITH REMAINDER
           DIVIDE 17 BY 5 GIVING RESULT
               REMAINDER REMAINDER-VALUE.
           *> RESULT = 3, REMAINDER = 2
           
           *> EXPONENTIATION
           COMPUTE RESULT = NUM-A ** 2.
           *> RESULT = 625.00
           
           *> COMPLEX EXPRESSION
           COMPUTE RESULT = 
               (NUM-A * 2) + (NUM-B / 2) - 3.
           *> (25.00 * 2) + (5.00 / 2) - 3 = 49.50
       
       STRING-OPERATIONS.
           *> CONCATENATION (STRING)
           STRING
               TEXT-A DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               TEXT-B DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO COMBINED-TEXT
           END-STRING.
           *> COMBINED-TEXT = "Hello World"
           
           *> STRING WITH DELIMITER
           STRING
               "Name: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               TEXT-A DELIMITED BY SPACE
               " | City: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               TEXT-B DELIMITED BY SPACE
               INTO COMBINED-TEXT
           END-STRING.
           *> COMBINED-TEXT = "Name: Hello | City: World"
       
       COMPARISON-OPERATIONS.
           IF NUM-A > NUM-B
               DISPLAY "NUM-A is greater"
           END-IF.
           
           IF NUM-A = NUM-B
               DISPLAY "They are equal"
           END-IF.
           
           IF NUM-A NOT = NUM-B
               DISPLAY "They are not equal"
           END-IF.
           
           IF NUM-A >= 20 AND NUM-B <= 10
               DISPLAY "Both conditions true"
           END-IF.
       
       LOGICAL-OPERATIONS.
           *> AND - Both must be true
           IF AGE >= 18 AND LICENSE-VALID = 'Y'
               DISPLAY "Can drive"
           END-IF.
           
           *> OR - At least one must be true
           IF STUDENT-STATUS = 'FULL'
               OR STUDENT-STATUS = 'PART'
               DISPLAY "Student enrolled"
           END-IF.
           
           *> NOT - Reverse condition
           IF NOT EOF-FLAG = 'Y'
               DISPLAY "More records"
           END-IF.
```

