### Practical Examples: Advanced Features

```cobol
       ADVANCED-FEATURES.
       
       COPY-STATEMENT.
           *> Copy copybook content
           COPY EMPLOYEE-RECORD.
           COPY DATABASE-CONSTANTS.
           
           *> With replacement
           COPY EMPLOYEE-RECORD
               REPLACING ==OLD-NAME== BY ==NEW-NAME==.
       
       INSPECT-TALLYING.
           MOVE "MISSISSIPPI" TO TEXT-VALUE.
           
           *> Count character occurrences
           INSPECT TEXT-VALUE TALLYING CHAR-COUNT
               FOR ALL "S".
           *> CHAR-COUNT = 4
           
