### Q2: Explain the 4 divisions of COBOL with a practical example.

**Answer:**

```cobol
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       *> WHO, WHAT, WHEN, WHY?
       PROGRAM-ID. EMPLOYEE-PAYROLL-PROCESSOR.
       AUTHOR. HR Systems Team.
       DATE-WRITTEN. 2024-01-15.
       PURPOSE. Calculate monthly payroll for all employees.
       REMARKS. Reads timecard file, calculates gross/net pay,
                generates payroll reports and checks.
       
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       *> WHERE? HOW? (I/O Configuration)
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT EMPLOYEE-FILE ASSIGN TO 'employees.dat'
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               RECORD KEY IS EMPLOYEE-ID.
           
           SELECT TIMECARD-FILE ASSIGN TO 'timecards.txt'
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
           
           SELECT PAYCHECK-FILE ASSIGN TO 'paychecks.txt'
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
       
       DATA DIVISION.
       *> WHAT DATA? (Structure & Definition)
       FILE SECTION.
       FD EMPLOYEE-FILE.
       01 EMPLOYEE-RECORD.
           05 EMPLOYEE-ID          PIC 9(7).
           05 EMPLOYEE-NAME        PIC X(40).
           05 HOURLY-RATE          PIC 9(4)V99.
           05 TAX-RATE             PIC 9V999.
       
       FD TIMECARD-FILE.
       01 TIMECARD-RECORD.
           05 EMP-ID               PIC 9(7).
           05 HOURS-WORKED         PIC 9(3)V99.
       
       FD PAYCHECK-FILE.
       01 PAYCHECK-OUTPUT          PIC X(100).
       
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-VARIABLES.
           05 WS-GROSS-PAY         PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 WS-TAX               PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 WS-NET-PAY           PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 WS-EOF               PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       *> HOW? (Business Logic)
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
           PERFORM INITIALIZE.
           PERFORM PROCESS-PAYROLL.
           PERFORM FINALIZE.
           STOP RUN.
       
       INITIALIZE.
           OPEN INPUT EMPLOYEE-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT TIMECARD-FILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT PAYCHECK-FILE.
       
       PROCESS-PAYROLL.
           PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
               READ TIMECARD-FILE
                   AT END
                       MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
                   NOT AT END
                       PERFORM CALCULATE-PAY
                       PERFORM PRINT-CHECK
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM.
       
       CALCULATE-PAY.
           COMPUTE WS-GROSS-PAY = HOURS-WORKED * HOURLY-RATE.
           COMPUTE WS-TAX = WS-GROSS-PAY * TAX-RATE.
           COMPUTE WS-NET-PAY = WS-GROSS-PAY - WS-TAX.
       
       PRINT-CHECK.
           STRING
               "Employee: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               EMPLOYEE-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
               " | Net Pay: $" DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-NET-PAY DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO PAYCHECK-OUTPUT
           END-STRING.
           WRITE PAYCHECK-OUTPUT.
       
       FINALIZE.
           CLOSE EMPLOYEE-FILE.
           CLOSE TIMECARD-FILE.
           CLOSE PAYCHECK-FILE.
```

