           ACCEPT SYSTEM-DATE FROM DATE YYYYMMDD.
           MOVE SYSTEM-DATE(1:4) TO YEAR.
           MOVE SYSTEM-DATE(5:2) TO MONTH.
           MOVE SYSTEM-DATE(7:2) TO DAY.
