## Payroll Processing System

### Theory: Payroll Business Logic

**Complex Rules:**
```
1. GROSS PAY CALCULATION
   If Hours > 40:
       Regular Pay = 40 × Hourly Rate
       Overtime = (Hours - 40) × Rate × 1.5
       Gross = Regular + Overtime
   Else:
       Gross = Hours × Hourly Rate

2. DEDUCTIONS
   Federal Tax = Gross × Federal %
   State Tax = Gross × State %
   Social Security = Gross × 6.2% (max $168,600)
   Medicare = Gross × 1.45%
   Health Insurance = Fixed amount
   401K = Gross × Employee % (pre-tax)

3. NET PAY
   Net = Gross - All Deductions

4. YTD TRACKING
   Track totals for W-2 reporting
```

