## Insurance Claims Processing

### Theory: Claims Workflow

```
CLAIMS PROCESSING STEPS:

1. CLAIM REGISTRATION
   ├─ Assign claim number
   ├─ Record claimant info
   ├─ Verify policy active
   └─ Set initial status

2. INITIAL VALIDATION
   ├─ Check coverage limits
   ├─ Verify deductible
   ├─ Check exclusions
   └─ Validate claim date

3. DOCUMENT REVIEW
   ├─ Receipt examination
   ├─ Photo analysis
   ├─ Professional opinion
   └─ Fraud check

4. CLAIM CALCULATION
   ├─ Determine eligible amount
   ├─ Apply deductible
   ├─ Apply limits
   └─ Calculate payout

5. PAYMENT PROCESSING
   ├─ Generate check
   ├─ Update ledger
   ├─ Record payment date
   └─ Archive files
```

**Insurance Claims System:**

```cobol
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INSURANCE-CLAIMS-PROCESSOR.
       
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 CLAIM-RECORD.
           05 CLAIM-ID               PIC 9(10).
           05 POLICY-NUMBER          PIC X(12).
           05 CLAIMANT-NAME          PIC X(40).
           05 CLAIM-DATE             PIC 9(8).
           05 CLAIM-AMOUNT           PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 CLAIM-CATEGORY         PIC X(20).
           05 CLAIM-STATUS           PIC X(1).
               88 APPROVED           VALUE 'A'.
               88 REJECTED           VALUE 'R'.
               88 PENDING            VALUE 'P'.
           05 APPROVAL-AMOUNT        PIC 9(7)V99.
       
       01 POLICY-COVERAGE.
           05 POLICY-DEDUCTIBLE      PIC 9(5)V99.
           05 POLICY-LIMIT           PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 COVERAGE-PERCENT       PIC 9V999.
       
       01 CLAIM-CALCULATION.
           05 ELIGIBLE-AMOUNT        PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 AFTER-DEDUCTIBLE       PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 WITH-COINSURANCE       PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 FINAL-AMOUNT           PIC 9(7)V99.
       
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       
       PROCESS-CLAIM.
           PERFORM VALIDATE-POLICY.
           PERFORM VALIDATE-COVERAGE.
           PERFORM CALCULATE-CLAIM-AMOUNT.
           PERFORM DETERMINE-APPROVAL.
           PERFORM PROCESS-PAYMENT.
       
       VALIDATE-POLICY.
           *> Check if policy is active
           *> Verify claimant eligibility
       
       VALIDATE-COVERAGE.
           *> Check if claim category is covered
           *> Verify not in exclusion list
       
       CALCULATE-CLAIM-AMOUNT.
           *> Step 1: Determine eligible amount
           IF CLAIM-AMOUNT <= POLICY-LIMIT
               MOVE CLAIM-AMOUNT TO ELIGIBLE-AMOUNT
           ELSE
               MOVE POLICY-LIMIT TO ELIGIBLE-AMOUNT
           END-IF.
           
           *> Step 2: Apply deductible
           COMPUTE AFTER-DEDUCTIBLE = 
               ELIGIBLE-AMOUNT - POLICY-DEDUCTIBLE.
           
           IF AFTER-DEDUCTIBLE < 0
               MOVE 0 TO AFTER-DEDUCTIBLE
           END-IF.
           
           *> Step 3: Apply coinsurance
           COMPUTE WITH-COINSURANCE = 
               AFTER-DEDUCTIBLE * COVERAGE-PERCENT.
           
           MOVE WITH-COINSURANCE TO FINAL-AMOUNT.
       
       DETERMINE-APPROVAL.
           IF FINAL-AMOUNT > 0
               MOVE 'A' TO CLAIM-STATUS
               MOVE FINAL-AMOUNT TO APPROVAL-AMOUNT
           ELSE
               MOVE 'R' TO CLAIM-STATUS
               MOVE 0 TO APPROVAL-AMOUNT
           END-IF.
       
       PROCESS-PAYMENT.
           IF APPROVED
               DISPLAY "Payment approved: $" APPROVAL-AMOUNT
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "Claim rejected"
           END-IF.
```

