   ├─ Use meaningful names
   ├─ Separate concerns
   └─ Maintain hierarchy

2. ERROR HANDLING
   ├─ Check all file operations
   ├─ Validate all inputs
   ├─ Log all errors
   └─ Graceful degradation

3. PERFORMANCE
   ├─ Use indexed access for lookups
   ├─ Avoid nested loops
   ├─ Pre-calculate constants
   └─ Batch operations

4. MAINTENANCE
   ├─ Clear comments
   ├─ Consistent naming
   ├─ Modular design
   └─ Version control
```

### Common Pitfalls

```
AVOID:

❌ Using GO TO (creates spaghetti code)
❌ Deep nesting (hard to follow)
❌ Ignoring file status codes
❌ No error logging
❌ Hardcoded values
❌ Massive programs (split into modules)
❌ No input validation
❌ Ignoring decimal precision
```

